// The setup's own words in Simplified Chinese, as the zh-Hans language
// pack holds them, for the setup's size test. Keyed by the engine's English.

[A random 128-bit number, made the first time you download from a registry, not when the game starts. Each registry that asks has its own. Core Prime asks for one. It is sent only when asking that registry for a download. Turning it off forgets it, and downloads from that registry stop. Built-in languages and files you open keep working.]
	{
	zh-Hans=一个128位的随机数，在你首次从某个内容源下载时生成，而不是在游戏启动时。每个要求它的内容源各有一个。Core Prime会要求一个。只在向该内容源请求下载时发送。关闭后即忘记它，来自该内容源的下载也会停止。内置语言和你打开的文件仍可使用。;
	}

[A random install ID, one per registry, is sent only when downloading from that registry.]
	{
	zh-Hans=每个内容源各有一个随机安装ID，仅在从该内容源下载时才会发送。;
	}

[Active]
	{
	zh-Hans=当前;
	}

[Back]
	{
	zh-Hans=返回;
	}

[Built in]
	{
	zh-Hans=内置;
	}

[Cancel download]
	{
	zh-Hans=取消下载;
	}

[Check for content updates is set to Never, and Core Prime's install ID is turned off.]
	{
	zh-Hans=检查内容更新已设为从不，并且Core Prime的安装ID已关闭。;
	}

[Check for content updates stays at Automatically, and Core Prime's install ID stays on.]
	{
	zh-Hans=检查内容更新保持为自动，并且Core Prime的安装ID保持打开。;
	}

