	zh-Hans=从Core Prime获取语言包、模组和地图包。;
	}

[Get, update and switch mods, map packs and languages. The number counts every package you have added: mods, map packs, language packs and expansions.]
	{
	zh-Hans=获取、更新和切换模组、地图包和语言。数字统计你添加的每个包：模组、地图包、语言包和扩展。;
	}

[Installed]
	{
	zh-Hans=已安装;
	}

